# Brand assets (type1and2.com)

Use the official PNG assets from `src/content/brand.ts`:

- **Mark (icon):** `BRAND_LOGO_MARK` → `/public/brand/logo-mark.png` — two figures / heart mark
- **Wordmark (text):** `BRAND_LOGO_WORDMARK` → `/public/brand/logo-wordmark.png` — stylized "type1and2"

Render logos via `BrandLogo` (`src/components/BrandLogo.tsx`), not inline SVG or Lucide icons.

**Tagline:** `PRODUCT_TAGLINE_EN` / `BRAND_TAGLINE` — "When it shifts, the right person knows."

**Favicon / PWA:** `/favicon.png` and `/icons/icon-*.png` derived from the mark.
